## 🗂️ Phase 7 — Table, Map & Code Box (Mobile Adaptations)

### 7.1 — Data Tables (Horizontal scroll, compact)
```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .data-table-container {
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  table { min-width: 600px; }
  th, td { padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.72rem; }
