### 7.2 — Map Panel (Full-width, fixed height)
```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  #pane-map .panel {
    height: auto;
    padding: 0;
  }

  #mainMap, #fullMap {
    height: 350px;
    border-radius: 0 0 18px 18px;
  }
}
```

### 7.3 — Code/Terminal Box
```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .code-box {
    height: 160px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }
}
```

### 7.4 — Particle Canvas
```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  #particleCanvas { height: 110px; }
}
```

### 7.5 — Chart containers
```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  /* Live Trend chart */
  [style*="height: 175px"] { height: 160px !important; }
  /* Forecast 24h chart */
  [style*="height: 280px"] { height: 210px !important; }
}
```

