## 🎨 Phase 8 — Micro Animations & Native Feel Polish

```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  /* Spring-y tap feedback on all interactive cards */
  .tile:active, .zone-card:active, .panel:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
    transition: transform 0.1s;
  }

  /* Pull-to-refresh visual cue (overscroll rubber band) */
  .view-pane { overscroll-behavior-y: contain; }

  /* Smooth scroll snap for horizontal carousels */
  .hero-action-pills {
    overflow-x: auto;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .hero-action-pills::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .action-pill { scroll-snap-align: start; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* Unplug alert banner — full attention on mobile */
  #unpluggedAlertBanner {
    border-radius: 14px;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  #unpluggedAlertBanner > div {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  #unpluggedAlertBanner .btn-action {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
  }
}
```

